# Global Company Layoff Analysis | Power BI & DAX

## Project Overview
This project analyzes global company layoffs from 2020 to 2023 using Power BI. It explores layoff trends across companies, countries, industries, and time periods to understand workforce reduction patterns.

## Tools Used
- Microsoft Power BI
- DAX
- Microsoft Excel

## Project Objectives
- Analyze total layoffs across the selected period.
- Identify companies with significant layoffs.
- Compare layoffs across countries and industries.
- Explore yearly and monthly layoff trends.
- Present key findings through interactive visualizations.

## Project Workflow
1. Reviewed the layoffs dataset.
2. Cleaned and prepared the data.
3. Built data visualizations in Power BI.
4. Created DAX measures, where applicable.
5. Designed an interactive dashboard.
6. Identified patterns and trends in company layoffs.

## Key Insights
- Examined global layoff trends from 2020 to 2023.
- Compared layoffs across companies and countries.
- Explored industry-level and time-based patterns.

